From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t7001: Describe the GPU

The A8X's GPU: the Rogue core's registers and Fender, the power
manager's and the two GPU bus bridges' registers (the driver powers the
GPU itself, in Apple's order), and its five interrupts, the fifth the
firmware's: AIC 134-138, matching the A8. The bridge window is 0xc1000,
from the two A8-style tables sitting further apart than on T7000. The
firmware is the G4G META LDR, named separately from the A8's G4P image.

Disabled until a board enables it.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001.dtsi | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001.dtsi
index 8716534b6..t7001gpu 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001.dtsi
@@ -129,6 +129,23 @@
 		nonposted-mmio;
 		ranges;
 
+		gpu: gpu@201000000 {
+			compatible = "apple,t7001-gpu", "apple,t7000-gpu";
+			reg = <0x2 0x01000000 0x0 0x100000>,
+			      <0x2 0x01e00000 0x0 0x100000>,
+			      <0x2 0x0e000000 0x0 0x40000>,
+			      <0x2 0x01f00000 0x0 0xc1000>;
+			reg-names = "rgx", "fender", "pmgr", "bridges";
+			interrupt-parent = <&aic>;
+			interrupts = <AIC_IRQ 134 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+				     <AIC_IRQ 135 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+				     <AIC_IRQ 136 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+				     <AIC_IRQ 137 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+				     <AIC_IRQ 138 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+			firmware-name = "apple/gfx-t7001.bin";
+			status = "disabled";
+		};
+
 		cpufreq: performance-controller@202220000 {
 			compatible = "apple,t7000-cluster-cpufreq", "apple,s5l8960x-cluster-cpufreq";
 			reg = <0x2 0x02220000 0 0x1000>;
